Model: MNIST Digit Recognition (mnist.tflite)
License status: UNVERIFIED (SPDX: NOASSERTION)

The weights come from a TensorFlow/Keras-style "mnist_cnn" example whose exact
upstream project and commit are not recorded in the N32EmbedAI repository.
Without that record the redistribution license cannot be confirmed, so this
model is not offered under the Apache-2.0 licence that covers the rest of this
repository.

Training data: MNIST (Yann LeCun, Corinna Cortes, Christopher J.C. Burges).
The official MNIST page stated no licence or terms of use. TensorFlow/Keras
documentation states: "MNIST dataset is made available under the terms of the
Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 license."
https://keras.io/api/datasets/mnist/

Do not rely on this model for a commercial product until the upstream example
is recorded (project + commit) or the model is replaced. See ../../README.md
("两个必须先确认的缺口").
